      "updated": 1793262049
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae301e000000000008270a1",
      "text": "\t[2026-10-29 近況 - YouTube https://www.youtube.com/shorts/E2xtxlOIO0g]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262049,
      "updated": 1793262052
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae301e200000000008270a2",
      "text": "\t\tこういうまとめ動画くらいはそろそろAIで何とかできそうだなぁ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262052,
      "updated": 1793262143
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae301ee00000000008270a3",
      "text": "\t\t各動画を解析させていい感じで撮ってもらって、フェードしながらつなげる、かつショートなので1分に収まるように",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262063,
      "updated": 1793262094
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3020900000000008270a4",
      "text": "\t動画編集 x AI",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262094,
      "updated": 1793262167
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3025600000000008270a7",
      "text": "\t\tとりあえず[ffmpeg]が便利ってことはわかった",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1793262167,
      "updated": 1793262347
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3026e00000000008270a8",
      "text": "\t\tシャッフルダンス動画を解析させるのは無理っぽい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262193,
      "updated": 1793262202
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3027d00000000008270a9",
      "text": "\t\t\t足元しかヒントがないし、変化も小さい上に早い",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262207,
      "updated": 1793262221
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3024d00000000008270a6",
      "text": "\tそろそろ冬だなぁ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262159,
      "updated": 1793262319
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae302ee00000000008270ab",
      "text": "\t\t暖房つけたしウルトラライトガウンも出した",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262319,
      "updated": 1793262328
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3032400000000008270ac",
      "text": "\tシャッフルダンスゲームを考えている",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262373,
      "updated": 1793262379
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3032a00000000008270ad",
      "text": "\t\tBPMに合わせてノーツ（動き方の指示）だけ出すツール",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262379,
      "updated": 1793262396
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3033d00000000008270ae",
      "text": "\t\tが、むずかしい、中々ゲームとして成立してくれない",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262399,
      "updated": 1793262407
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3053700000000008270bc",
      "text": "\t\t\t特にノーツはまじでシンプルにしないといけない",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262905,
      "updated": 1793262914
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3055200000000008270bd",
      "text": "\t\t\t\thttps://stakiran.github.io/shuffledance-player/ こんなの複雑すぎて無理すぎた",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262932,
      "updated": 1793262938
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3044e00000000008270ba",
      "text": "\t\t紙に書いたの久々だわ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262672,
      "updated": 1793262691
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3034600000000008270af",
      "text": "\t\t\t[https://gyazo.com/08261a47ae9445943b6f061f2736610e]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262407,
      "updated": 1793262640
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3042f00000000008270b8",
      "text": "\t\t[Excalidraw]も重宝している",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262640,
      "updated": 1793262652
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3043000000000008270b9",
      "text": "\t\t\t[https://gyazo.com/82a8fa6d1c728a04016b876eb4bbd12d]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262641,
      "updated": 1793262645
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae308ed00000000005802cf",
      "text": "\t\t\t\t良い[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793263854,
      "updated": 1793263858
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3034700000000008270b0",
      "text": "\t\tそう考えると[DANCERUSH STARDOM]ってよく練られてるんだなぁ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262409,
      "updated": 1793262433
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3036500000000008270b3",
      "text": "\t\t\t舐めてた。シャッフルダンスのゲーム、むずすぎぃ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262439,
      "updated": 1793262445
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3037700000000008270b4",
      "text": "\t\t\t僕ほど音ゲーやっててシャッフルダンスも音ゲー的に捉えててひとりで脳内で遊ぶほどの変わり者（単体じゃなくてアンドを取れてるという意味で）はたぶんそうはいなくて、その僕でも全然歯が立たなくて。ゲームを成立させるために、針の穴を通す感じのバランスの模索が必要な感じ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262456,
      "updated": 1793262746
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3049a00000000008270bb",
      "text": "\t\tたぶん壁が二つあるんだろうなぁ、ゲームを成立させるための小さな穴（第一）と、それ見つけた後のゲームバランスのの模索（第二）。第一を越えられん",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262747,
      "updated": 1793262780
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae303b900000000008270b5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793262522,
      "updated": 1793262549
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3173e00000000000274de",
      "text": "[wogikaze.icon]",
      "userId": "64099110a39a5c001c8a016e",
      "created": 1793267520,
      "updated": 1793267520
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3173e00000000000274df",
      "text": " [Uni](Chrome 拡張機能)がオフになってて通知が来ている",
      "userId": "64099110a39a5c001c8a016e",
      "created": 1793267521,
      "updated": 1793267544
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3175500000000000274e1",
      "text": "  [/motoso-uni]",
      "userId": "64099110a39a5c001c8a016e",
      "created": 1793267544,
      "updated": 1793267686
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3182d00000000000274e2",
      "text": "  何だろう",
      "userId": "64099110a39a5c001c8a016e",
      "created": 1793267760,
      "updated": 1793267761
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3173f00000000000274e0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "64099110a39a5c001c8a016e",
      "created": 1793267521,
      "updated": 1793267521
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31a1100000000001d2f2c",
      "text": "[Aria.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268241,
      "updated": 1793268243
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31a1400000000001d2f2e",
      "text": " 久々に[鬼斬]というゲームタイトルをSNSで見た",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268244,
      "updated": 1793268275
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31a3300000000001d2f2f",
      "text": "  昔やってたが当時の自分には操作性が合わな過ぎてやめた",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268275,
      "updated": 1793268322
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31a7800000000001d2f31",
      "text": " [喰霊-零-]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268344,
      "updated": 1793268352
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31a8100000000001d2f32",
      "text": "  無性に見たくなった",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268353,
      "updated": 1793268387
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31aa400000000001d2f33",
      "text": "  原作の[喰霊]は番外編込み全巻、自宅にある",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268389,
      "updated": 1793268429
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31acd00000000001d2f34",
      "text": " 実家には幼少期の分含めて何もない",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268429,
      "updated": 1793268469
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31ae500000000001d2f35",
      "text": "  たまに[帰省]するが他人の家みたいな感覚に陥って落ち着かない",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268453,
      "updated": 1793268577
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31b6100000000001d2f36",
      "text": "   こちらが一人暮らし始めてから、両親が買ったマンションというのも一つの理由",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268577,
      "updated": 1793268655
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae31b8b00000000001d2f37",
      "text": "    自分の影がまるでない",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793268619,
      "updated": 1793268631
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3321b0000000000feb34f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793274393,
      "updated": 1793274393
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3321b0000000000feb350",
      "text": "[nejimaki.icon]",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793274393,
      "updated": 1793274395
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3321e0000000000feb352",
      "text": "\tアジカンの『ファンクラブ』2026年リマスター版を聞いてるけど音質めちゃいいね！",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793274396,
      "updated": 1793274562
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae344be0000000000feb354",
      "text": "\t[https://www.nejimakiblog.com/entry/ai-fomo-hayari-okure-boom-chatgpt 「生成AIのトレンドにあえて遅れをとる」という贅沢 - 世界のねじを巻くブログ]",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793279163,
      "updated": 1793279175
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae344ca0000000000feb357",
      "text": "\t\tあえて立ち止まる、という選択肢もあるよという話。",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793279176,
      "updated": 1793279199
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae344be0000000000feb356",
      "text": " ",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793279164,
      "updated": 1793279164
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3322c0000000000feb353",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6303abe85eed77001d707837",
      "created": 1793274410,
      "updated": 1793274547
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35d060000000000d2bdd3",
      "text": "[mtane0412.icon]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285383,
      "updated": 1793285384
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35d080000000000d2bdd5",
      "text": " https://hanatane.net/20261029-muse-home-agent/",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285385,
      "updated": 1793285392
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35d110000000000d2bdd6",
      "text": "  書いた",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285394,
      "updated": 1793285397
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35d140000000000d2bdd7",
      "text": "  井戸端でURLの展開ができない",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285397,
      "updated": 1793285402
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3603700000000009e8024",
      "text": "  よい[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1793286199,
      "updated": 1793286203
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3611c0000000000693cbf",
      "text": "  他の人の使い方は学びがあり面白い[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793286429,
      "updated": 1793286437
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3a89300000000007f90e2",
      "text": "  なるほど、エージェント用のアカウントを用意すればいいのか[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1793304726,
      "updated": 1793304735
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35e340000000000d2bdd8",
      "text": " authorとしてmuseを追加して記事を書かせるのも考えた",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285685,
      "updated": 1793285703
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35e470000000000d2bdd9",
      "text": "  とはいえなんかつまらなくなりそう",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285703,
      "updated": 1793285714
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35ee00000000000d2bdda",
      "text": " [https://gyazo.com/5a4d49e0ff76dcd0b1902e04a0f84c61]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285857,
      "updated": 1793285859
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35ee60000000000d2bddc",
      "text": "  ｷｭﾝ...",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1793285863,
      "updated": 1793285866
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae35ee20000000000d2bddb",
